     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jigar,<div><br></div><div>It&#39;s strange that this comes up. You additionally made a small mistaken when attempting to install gtools. You should put quotation marks around it:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;gtools&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br>I would also recommend making sure that your version of poppr and adegenet are up to date.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Zhian</div></div>"
    ],
